                                                "sense_id": "92ea6d91-68f4-3f5b-a101-cb1bbb70027d",
                                                "text": "Adult male snowies are nearly white. They become whiter as they get older. Female birds are usually white with narrow black or brown bars and spots. Young snowies are darker than the adults, and they have heavier markings."
